      "text": "Figure 1 (left): PubHealthBench Full and Reviewed model accuracy across 24 LLMs. Proprietary models (GPT-4.5, GPT-4.1, o1) exceed 90% accuracy, outperforming human search baselines (88%), while open-weight models range from 45% to 85%.",
